          "prompt": "Use the uploaded storyboard image as visual inspiration for character appearance, outfit consistency, gym environment, and cinematic tone.\n\nCreate a realistic 10-second cinematic sports training video of a young woman exercising in a modern dark gym. Maintain consistent hairstyle, facial features, athletic outfit, and natural documentary-style lighting throughout the video.\n\nScene progression:\n\n0–2s: close-up portrait before training, calm focused breathing, natural gym atmosphere.\n2–4s: stretching arms and shoulders in front of a mirror with controlled athletic movement.\n4–6s: walking toward the weight rack and preparing for training.\n6–8s: adjusting the training bar across her shoulders with professional posture.\n8–10s: performing a controlled athletic lower-body exercise with stable posture and realistic movement.\n\nVisual style: cinematic sports documentary, handheld camera, soft film grain, muted black and grey tones, shallow depth of field, realistic shadows, authentic gym environment, natural motion.\n\nThe video should feel like a real behind-the-scenes fitness training session, respectful and professional in tone, with no glamour or fashion-commercial styling.\n\nAvoid: unrealistic anatomy, distorted hands, inconsistent face, exaggerated body proportions, cartoon style, glossy beauty retouching, text, watermark, broken equipment.",
