          "node_name": "Flow - Video 02",
          "node_type": "generate",
          "provider": null,
          "prompt": "Use the uploaded storyboard image as visual inspiration for character appearance, outfit consistency, gym environment, and cinematic tone.\n\nCreate a realistic cinematic 10-second continuation video inside the same dark modern gym / pilates studio environment. Maintain a consistent female character appearance, including hairstyle, facial features, skin tone, body proportions, and the same black athletic training outfit throughout the video.\n\nThe scene focuses on the final moments of an intense workout session: controlled effort, recovery, fatigue, and quiet confidence.\n\nScene progression:\n\n0–2s: medium shot of her performing a controlled strength-training movement with a training bar across her shoulders, focused breathing, natural athletic posture.\n2–4s: close-up portrait after the exercise set, subtle workout fatigue visible in her expression, eyes looking downward, controlled breathing.\n4–6s: she pauses to recover with hands resting near her knees, gym racks and equipment softly blurred in the background, natural body movement from exertion.\n6–8s: she gently wipes her face with a white towel and gives a small natural smile, candid and unposed.\n8–10s: final portrait shot near the weight rack, calm confident expression, slightly messy hair, soft side window light, relaxed post-workout atmosphere.\n\nVisual style: realistic cinematic sports documentary, muted black and grey color palette, authentic gym atmosphere, natural skin texture, realistic fabric movement, soft film grain, subtle motion blur, shallow depth of field, handheld but stable camera feeling.\n\nCamera style: intimate close-ups, medium handheld shots, slow push-in during the final portrait, realistic focus transitions, natural documentary cinematography, 35mm and 50mm lens aesthetic.\n\nThe video should feel like a genuine behind-the-scenes fitness training session captured by a real camera — grounded, emotional, natural, and believable rather than polished or commercial.\n\nAvoid: inconsistent face or outfit, unrealistic anatomy, distorted hands, extra limbs, broken gym equipment, floating objects, exaggerated body proportions, artificial beauty retouching, glossy fashion-ad styling, cartoon style, anime style, 3D render look, overexposed lighting, text, logo, watermark.",
