          "node_name": "Prompt 2",
          "node_type": "prompt",
          "provider": null,
          "prompt": "Create a vertical storyboard illustration in a minimalist hand-drawn cartoon stickman style, showing 3 sequential frames arranged like a cinematic storyboard sheet.\n\nIMPORTANT: Each frame must have a clear visible label at the top-left corner, written in simple white handwritten text:\n“FRAME 05 — 10s–13s”\n“FRAME 06 — 13s–16.5s”\n“FRAME 07 — 16.5s–20s”\n\nStyle: tiny hand-drawn stickman child, muted navy blue background, thick uneven black outlines, cinematic side lighting, soft emotional tone, symbolic healing imagery, simple composition.\n\nFRAME 05 — 10s–13s:\nA tiny stickman child notices a smaller inner-child version of themselves sitting alone in the shadow.\n\nFRAME 06 — 13s–16.5s:\nThe main stickman gently kneels down and places one hand on the shoulder of the smaller inner-child version.\n\nFRAME 07 — 16.5s–20s:\nA soft side light slowly enters the scene as the two figures connect, creating a feeling of tenderness, self-compassion, and inner healing.\n\nStoryboard look: clean frame divisions, visible frame labels, minimalistic but expressive, soft visual storytelling, emotional progression from loneliness to self-care.\n\nAdd small Vietnamese subtitle under each frame:\nFRAME 05: “Người nên quan tâm đến bạn nhất…”\nFRAME 06: “Chính là bạn.”\nFRAME 07: “Hãy dịu dàng với chính mình hơn.”\n\nAspect ratio: 9:16.",
