          "node_type": "prompt",
          "provider": null,
          "prompt": "Create a vertical storyboard illustration in a minimalist hand-drawn cartoon stickman style, showing 4 sequential frames arranged like a cinematic contact-sheet storyboard.\n\nIMPORTANT: Each frame must have a clear visible label at the top-left corner, written in simple white handwritten text:\n“FRAME 08 — 20s–22.5s”\n“FRAME 09 — 22.5s–25s”\n“FRAME 10 — 25s–27.5s”\n“FRAME 11 — 27.5s–30s”\n\nStyle: tiny stickman child, muted navy blue background, thick black outlines, vivid gentle expression, cinematic side lighting, emotional healing atmosphere, simple symbolic composition.\n\nFRAME 08 — 20s–22.5s:\nThe tiny stickman slowly stands taller as a warm side light begins to enter and the shadow behind becomes softer.\n\nFRAME 09 — 22.5s–25s:\nThe stickman smiles gently for the first time, with a small glowing star appearing beside the face.\n\nFRAME 10 — 25s–27.5s:\nThe stickman steps out from the dark shadow into a softer area of light, posture lighter and more confident.\n\nFRAME 11 — 27.5s–30s:\nThe stickman stands calmly under a soft dawn-like beam of light, centered in a wide quiet space, expressing peace, optimism, and self-acceptance.\n\nStoryboard look: clean panel borders, visible frame labels, emotional visual rhythm, minimal but cinematic, strong sense of transformation from darkness to light.\n\nAdd small Vietnamese subtitle under each frame:\nFRAME 08: “Bạn phải vui lên một chút.”\nFRAME 09: “Lúc bạn cười…”\nFRAME 10: “Bạn đẹp hơn rất nhiều.”\nFRAME 11: “Hãy sống lạc quan, đúng với chính mình.”\n\nAspect ratio: 9:16.",
