          "slug": "flow_images_videos_genera_3_1_",
          "slug_auto": true,
          "node_name": "Video 02 - Vui lên và sống đúng với chính mình",
          "node_type": "generate",
          "provider": null,
          "prompt": "Create a 10-second vertical animated video, aspect ratio 9:16, using the provided storyboard image only as a scene reference.\n\nCRITICAL VISUAL RULE:\nThe input image is a storyboard sheet, but the final video must NOT show the storyboard sheet.\nThe final video must NOT show multiple panels, multiple frames, borders, labels, grid layout, or contact-sheet layout.\nThe final video must show only ONE full-screen scene at a time.\nEach labeled frame from the storyboard must be isolated, cropped, expanded, and animated as a separate full-screen 9:16 cinematic shot.\nRemove all storyboard borders, panel dividers, and frame labels from the final video.\nDo not display the original storyboard layout at any moment.\n\nUse only these 4 scenes in this exact order:\n\nSCENE 01 — 0s–2.5s:\nUse the visual content from FRAME 08 only. Show it as a single full-screen scene.\nThe tiny stickman slowly stands taller as a warm side light begins to enter and the shadow behind becomes softer.\n\nVoice-over and subtitle:\n“Bạn phải vui lên một chút.”\n\nSCENE 02 — 2.5s–5s:\nUse the visual content from FRAME 09 only. Show it as a single full-screen scene.\nThe stickman smiles gently for the first time, with a small glowing star appearing beside the face.\n\nVoice-over and subtitle:\n“Lúc bạn cười…”\n\nSCENE 03 — 5s–7.5s:\nUse the visual content from FRAME 10 only. Show it as a single full-screen scene.\nThe stickman steps out from the dark shadow into a softer area of light, posture lighter and more confident.\n\nVoice-over and subtitle:\n“Bạn đẹp hơn rất nhiều.”\n\nSCENE 04 — 7.5s–10s:\nUse the visual content from FRAME 11 only. Show it as a single full-screen scene.\nThe stickman stands calmly under a soft dawn-like beam of light, centered in a wide quiet space.\n\nVoice-over and subtitle:\n“Hãy sống lạc quan, đúng với chính mình.”\n\nAudio requirement:\nThe video must include Vietnamese voice-over narration.\nThe voice-over must be a deep, calm Vietnamese male voice.\nThe narration must be audible from beginning to end.\nDo not create a silent video.\n\nSubtitle requirement:\nAdd Vietnamese subtitles at the bottom center of the screen.\nSubtitles must match the spoken words exactly.\nEach subtitle must appear only during its matching voice-over line.\nDo not show all subtitles at once.\nUse clean white text with a subtle dark shadow.\n\nVisual style:\nMinimalist hand-drawn cartoon stickman style, tiny stickman child, muted navy blue background, thick uneven black outlines, cinematic side lighting, soft shadows, emotional healing atmosphere, symbolic visual storytelling, simple composition, gentle transformation from darkness to light.\n\nMotion direction:\nSlow rising posture, gentle light transition, subtle smile movement, tiny glowing star softly twinkling, one or two light steps forward, slow pull-back camera at the end.\nKeep the video poetic, cinematic, healing, and optimistic.\n\nNEGATIVE INSTRUCTIONS:\nNo storyboard sheet.\nNo multiple frames in one shot.\nNo split screen.\nNo panel grid.\nNo comic page layout.\nNo contact sheet.\nNo visible frame labels.\nNo borders between panels.\nNo collage layout.\nNo showing the full reference image.\nOnly one full-screen scene at a time.",
