          "node_type": "prompt",
          "provider": null,
          "prompt": "Use Image 1 as the handbag reference.\nUse Image 2 as the human review pose and scene reference.\n\nCreate one ultra-realistic 3x3 storyboard image containing 9 separate vertical panels.\nEach panel must show the same handbag from Image 1 being reviewed naturally by a person in the style of Image 2.\n\nIMPORTANT — REFERENCE ROLES\nImage 1 is the product reference. Use it only for the handbag identity.\nImage 2 is the review composition and human pose reference. Use it for the overall idea of a person sitting or leaning near the bag and reviewing it naturally.\nThe final result must look like a real professional product review storyboard.\nThe reviewer’s face must not be clearly visible. The face should be cropped out, turned away, hidden, or outside the frame.\nOnly show the upper body, arms, hands, and part of the torso when needed.\nSAME BAG LOCK\n\nIn all 9 panels, the bag must remain the same exact handbag from Image 1:\n\npreserve the exact shape\npreserve the exact proportions\npreserve the exact color\npreserve the exact material and texture\npreserve the exact handles\npreserve the exact zipper layout\npreserve the exact seams and stitching\npreserve the exact logo placement\ndo not redesign the bag\ndo not change the bag structure\nSCENE STYLE\n\nUse the style of Image 2:\n\nclean minimalist studio-like scene\nneutral elegant background\nsoft premium lighting\nsimple product-review setup\nthe bag placed on a clean platform / table / block\na real person is interacting with the bag naturally\nthe mood should feel like a premium brand product demonstration\nREVIEWER REQUIREMENTS\nThe reviewer is visible only partially.\nDo not show a clear face.\nFace may be cropped out above the mouth, turned away, hidden, or outside the frame.\nShow only hands, forearms, torso, and partial seated posture if helpful.\nThe reviewer should wear simple clean clothing similar in feel to the reference, such as a minimal casual sweater or lounge outfit.\nThe pose must feel natural, relaxed, and premium.\nHands must look realistic and anatomically correct.\nSTORYBOARD LAYOUT\nCreate a 3x3 grid with 9 panels total.\nEach panel must be a vertical photo frame.\nAll 9 panels must feel like they belong to the same review session.\nKeep lighting, color mood, bag identity, and reviewer styling consistent across all panels.\nNo text, no captions, no numbers, no logos, no labels, no watermark.\n9 REVIEW ACTIONS / PANEL CONTENT\n\nEach panel should show a different natural review action.\nUse these as the content guide:\n\nHero setup\nThe bag is placed on the platform. The reviewer’s hands rest near the top zipper, introducing the product.\nOpening the top zipper\nOne hand pulls the top zipper open slightly, the other hand steadies the bag.\nShowing the opening\nBoth hands gently open the top area to show the main compartment access.\nHolding the handle\nOne hand lifts the handle slightly to show handle shape and flexibility.\nTouching the front/body material\nOne hand presses or smooths the bag’s surface to show texture and structure.\nTurning the bag slightly to the left 3/4 angle\nThe reviewer repositions the bag to show the side and overall silhouette.\nTurning the bag slightly to the right 3/4 angle\nAnother review angle showing side structure and proportions.\nSupporting the base / showing the bottom feel\nOne hand supports the bottom while the other steadies the top or handle.\nFinal clean presentation pose\nA premium ending frame with the bag presented neatly, one hand near the handle and one hand lightly touching the bag.\nCAMERA & PHOTO STYLE\nultra-realistic\n100% photorealistic\nprofessional camera quality\nluxury commercial product photography\nshallow depth of field\nsoft realistic background blur when appropriate\nsharp focus on the bag and hands\nclean premium light\nsoft shadows\nrealistic contact shadows\nrealistic object weight\nrealistic skin texture\nrealistic fabric texture\npolished but natural\nnot AI-looking\nCOMPOSITION\nThe handbag must remain the hero object in every frame.\nThe bag should occupy a large and clear area in each panel.\nThe reviewer should support the bag visually, not overpower it.\nKeep the framing elegant and balanced.\nThe face must never become the focus.\nPrioritize clear product visibility.\nREALISM REQUIREMENTS\nno distorted hands\nno extra fingers\nno missing fingers\nno broken anatomy\nno floating bag\nno warped bag shape\nno inconsistent product details\nno unrealistic zipper behavior\nno fake shadows\nno plastic skin\nno AI look\nno background inconsistency\nNEGATIVE PROMPT\n\ncartoon, illustration, CGI, 3D render, fake product photo, AI-looking, distorted hands, extra fingers, missing fingers, broken fingers, deformed bag, warped handles, wrong bag color, wrong zipper placement, floating bag, unrealistic shadows, oversmoothed skin, plastic texture, messy composition, face clearly visible, portrait focus, full body visible, text, watermark, label, logo overlay\n\nThe final result must look like a real 3x3 storyboard from a professional handbag review photoshoot, using the same bag in all 9 panels, with a partially visible reviewer naturally demonstrating the product, while the face remains unclear or not visible.\n\nBản ngắn gọn hơn để dễ copy\n\nSHORT PROMPT\n\nUse Image 1 as the handbag reference and Image 2 as the reviewer pose/scene reference. Create one ultra-realistic 3x3 storyboard image with 9 vertical panels. In all 9 panels, show the same exact handbag from Image 1 being reviewed naturally by a person styled like Image 2. Keep the face unclear or not visible at all — only show hands, arms, torso, and partial seated posture. Use a clean premium studio-like setup with soft lighting and a simple product-review composition.\n\nShow 9 different review moments:\n\nhero pose,\nopening the top zipper,\nshowing the main opening,\nlifting the handle,\ntouching the bag material,\nleft 3/4 angle,\nright 3/4 angle,\nsupporting the base,\nfinal clean presentation.\n\nKeep the exact same bag design, color, shape, texture, handles, seams, zipper layout, and logo placement in every panel. Make the result look like a real professional camera product-review storyboard, with no text, no watermark, no AI look, no distorted hands, and no clearly visible face.",
