          "node_type": "prompt",
          "provider": null,
          "prompt": "Use Image 1 as the handbag reference.\nUse Image 2 as the main pose, outfit, body posture, phone-covering-face composition, and indoor lifestyle scene reference.\n\nCreate one ultra-realistic vertical 9:16 lifestyle phone-selfie style photo of a woman holding / carrying the handbag from Image 1.\n\nIMPORTANT — REFERENCE ROLES\nImage 1 is only for the handbag identity.\nImage 2 is the main reference for the woman’s pose, outfit mood, phone position, body posture, indoor setting, and faceless composition.\nThe final image must look like a real candid lifestyle photo taken indoors with a phone-style composition.\nIMPORTANT — NO MIRROR VISIBLE\nDo not show any mirror.\nDo not show a mirror frame.\nDo not show a mirror edge.\nDo not show a reflective glass surface.\nDo not show the woman as a mirror reflection.\nDo not create a dressing-room mirror selfie.\nDo not include any visible reflection artifacts.\n\nThe final image should look like a direct lifestyle camera shot / phone-style outfit photo, not a photo taken through a visible mirror.\n\nThe woman can still hold a phone in front of her face, but the image must not show the actual mirror object.\nThe composition should feel like a clean vertical lifestyle photo where the phone naturally hides the face.\n\nSTRICT NO-FACE REQUIREMENT\nThe woman’s face must not be clearly visible.\nThe phone must naturally block the face.\nDo not show clear eyes, nose, mouth, cheeks, chin, jawline, or any recognizable facial details.\nDo not turn the face toward the camera.\nDo not create a portrait look.\nThe image must feel faceless and privacy-safe.\nThe phone should cover the face completely or crop the face out of the frame.\nMODEL / POSE REQUIREMENTS\n\nKeep the woman in a natural standing pose similar to Image 2.\nPreserve the relaxed feminine posture:\n\none hand holding the phone in front of the face\nthe other hand naturally holding or carrying the handbag\nbody slightly relaxed, casual, stylish, and believable\n\nKeep the vibe soft, minimal, effortless, and realistic.\n\nOUTFIT & SCENE REQUIREMENTS\nPreserve the same cozy light-colored loungewear / sweatshirt and pants mood from Image 2.\nKeep a minimalist indoor home setting.\nMaintain clean wall, soft natural indoor light, and modern lifestyle atmosphere.\nThe photo should feel like a real at-home outfit check / lifestyle product photo.\nKeep the vertical smartphone composition.\nHANDBAG REQUIREMENTS\n\nInsert the handbag from Image 1 into the scene naturally.\n\nThe handbag must remain the same exact bag as Image 1:\n\nexact shape\nexact size proportions\nexact color\nexact material and texture\nexact handles / straps\nexact seams / zipper layout\nexact logo placement\nexact hardware details\n\nDo not redesign the bag.\nDo not change the bag material or color.\nDo not add or remove straps, logos, zippers, seams, or hardware.\n\nIMPORTANT — BAG SCALE / SIZE IN FRAME\n\nThe bag currently appears slightly too small.\nIn the final image, make the handbag appear slightly larger and more prominent while still looking physically realistic and natural.\n\nThe bag should read visually as a medium-large weekender / duffel bag.\nIncrease the apparent bag size by approximately 10–20% compared with the previous result.\nKeep the bag’s original proportions unchanged, but make its on-body scale slightly larger.\nThe bag should feel substantial, not mini or undersized.\nWhen carried, the bag should appear large enough to be a noticeable statement item in the outfit.\nThe bag should occupy a stronger visual presence in the frame and be clearly readable.\nDo not make the bag oversized or exaggerated; it should just be a bit bigger than before.\n\nThe bag placement should feel physically correct and natural, for example:\n\nhanging from the forearm\nheld by the top handles\nresting beside the hip\nlightly touching the body\n\nIf needed, use camera perspective, bag placement, or arm position to make the bag feel a little larger, while preserving realism.\n\nPHOTO STYLE\nUltra-realistic\n100% photorealistic\nProfessional smartphone lifestyle photography\nNatural indoor lighting\nRealistic fabric texture\nRealistic handbag texture\nRealistic hand anatomy\nBelievable body posture\nClean, soft, premium lifestyle aesthetic\nNot AI-looking\nCOMPOSITION\nVertical 9:16\nFull body or 3/4 body framing\nThe woman remains the lifestyle context, but the handbag must be clearly visible and visually important\nKeep the bag fully readable in the frame\nThe phone must remain visible in front of the face\nNo visible mirror, no mirror frame, no mirror reflection\nThe perspective must look natural and realistic\nCompose the frame so the bag has slightly more visual importance than before\nREALISM REQUIREMENTS\nNo distorted hands\nNo extra fingers\nNo missing fingers\nNo broken body proportions\nNo floating bag\nNo fake shadows\nNo unrealistic lighting\nNo bag deformation\nNo face reveal\nNo visible mirror\nNo reflection artifacts\nNo AI look\nNEGATIVE PROMPT\n\ncartoon, CGI, 3D render, AI-looking, mirror, mirror frame, mirror edge, visible mirror, reflective glass, reflection, dressing room mirror, bathroom mirror, mirror selfie reflection, warped reflection, distorted hands, extra fingers, missing fingers, deformed body, floating bag, unrealistic shadows, plastic skin, oversmoothed skin, visible full face, clear eyes, clear nose, clear mouth, clear chin, clear cheeks, portrait shot, bad anatomy, low quality, blurry subject, watermark, text, logo overlay, tiny bag, undersized bag, miniature-looking bag\n\nThe final image must look like a real indoor lifestyle outfit photo of a woman holding the handbag naturally, with the phone hiding her face, with no visible mirror or reflection anywhere, and with the handbag appearing slightly larger and more visually prominent than in the previous result.\n\nAspect ratio: 9:16\n\nMake the aspect ratio 9:16",
