          "prompt": "Use Image 1 as the main video reference.\nImage 1 is the already-composited mirror-selfie photo showing the woman holding the handbag.\n\nUse Image 2 as the handbag identity reference only.\n\nCreate a 10-second ultra-realistic vertical 9:16 mirror-selfie lifestyle video of the woman in Image 1 filming herself in the mirror while posing naturally with the handbag.\n\nThe final video must look like a real smartphone mirror video, not AI-generated.\n\nIMPORTANT — REFERENCE ROLES\n\nImage 1 = Main reference\nUse Image 1 for:\n\nthe exact woman pose\nthe mirror-selfie composition\nthe phone covering the face\nthe outfit\nthe indoor background\nthe body proportions\nthe lighting\nthe handbag placement\nthe overall lifestyle mood\n\nImage 2 = Handbag reference\nUse Image 2 only to preserve the handbag identity:\n\nexact handbag shape\nexact color\nexact material\nexact handles / straps\nexact seams\nexact zipper placement\nexact logo placement\nexact proportions\n\nDo not copy the background, person, pose, or lighting from Image 2.\nOnly use Image 2 to keep the handbag accurate.\n\nSTRICT NO-FACE REQUIREMENT\n\nThe woman’s face must never be clearly visible during the entire video.\n\nThe phone must continuously cover the face in the mirror reflection.\nDo not show clear eyes, nose, mouth, cheeks, chin, jawline, or any recognizable facial details.\nDo not move the phone away from the face.\nDo not reveal the face from a side angle.\nDo not show a blurred face.\nDo not show a hidden-but-visible face.\nDo not show the face in any mirror reflection.\n\nThe video must remain a faceless mirror-selfie product styling video.\n\nCONSISTENCY REQUIREMENTS\n\nKeep the following consistent for the full 10 seconds:\n\nsame woman from Image 1\nsame outfit from Image 1\nsame mirror-selfie framing from Image 1\nsame indoor home background from Image 1\nsame phone position covering the face\nsame handbag placement style from Image 1\nsame handbag design from Image 2\nsame lighting mood\nsame vertical 9:16 smartphone look\n\nDo not change the room.\nDo not change the outfit.\nDo not change the phone.\nDo not change the handbag design.\nDo not reveal the face.\n\nVIDEO STYLE\nultra-realistic\n100% photorealistic\nreal smartphone mirror-selfie video\nnatural indoor lighting\nclean lifestyle fashion aesthetic\nsubtle handheld phone movement\nrealistic mirror reflection\nrealistic body movement\nrealistic fabric movement\nrealistic handbag weight\nno AI look\nno CGI look\nDETAILED 10-SECOND TIMELINE\n0.0s – 1.0s\n\nStart from the exact composition of Image 1.\nThe woman stands in front of the mirror, holding the phone in front of her face.\nThe handbag is already visible and positioned naturally beside her body.\nShe holds still for a clean opening mirror-selfie frame.\n\n1.0s – 2.0s\n\nShe slightly shifts her weight onto one leg.\nThe handbag moves subtly with her arm.\nThe phone remains fixed in front of the face, fully blocking it.\n\n2.0s – 3.0s\n\nShe gently lifts the handbag a little higher by the handle or strap, showing the bag shape more clearly.\nThe movement is slow, natural, and realistic.\nThe bag must feel weighted, not floating.\n\n3.0s – 4.0s\n\nShe angles her torso slightly to the left, creating a soft fashion pose.\nThe handbag swings very slightly and naturally.\nThe face remains completely hidden behind the phone.\n\n4.0s – 5.0s\n\nHer free hand lightly adjusts the sweatshirt or waistband, similar to a casual mirror styling moment.\nThe handbag stays visible and stable near her side.\nKeep the pose elegant and effortless.\n\n5.0s – 6.0s\n\nShe brings the handbag slightly forward toward the mirror, as if highlighting it.\nThe bag should become more visually prominent while staying physically connected to her hand or arm.\n\n6.0s – 7.0s\n\nShe turns her body slightly to the right, showing another angle of the handbag.\nThe bag’s shape, handles, seams, zipper, and logo must remain consistent with Image 2.\n\n7.0s – 8.0s\n\nShe pauses briefly in a clean pose.\nThe phone still fully covers her face.\nThe handbag is clearly visible as the main fashion accessory.\n\n8.0s – 9.0s\n\nShe slightly lowers the bag, then adjusts it back into a flattering position.\nThe movement should feel like a real person checking the look in the mirror.\n\n9.0s – 10.0s\n\nFinal hero mirror-selfie pose.\nShe stands naturally with the handbag positioned clearly beside her outfit.\nHold the final frame steadily.\nThe phone continues covering the face completely until the end.\n\nMOTION REQUIREMENTS\nmovements must be smooth and continuous\nno jump cuts\nno teleporting pose changes\nno fast motion\nno unnatural bag swing\nno floating handbag\nhandbag must move with realistic weight\nphone must remain in front of the face\nmirror reflection must remain stable and realistic\nHANDBAG LOCK\n\nThe handbag must remain identical to Image 2 throughout the video:\n\nsame color\nsame shape\nsame fabric/material\nsame handle length\nsame strap placement\nsame zipper placement\nsame seams\nsame logo placement\nsame size proportion relative to the woman\n\nDo not morph the bag.\nDo not change the logo.\nDo not change the color.\nDo not add or remove straps.\nDo not deform the bag.\n\nNEGATIVE PROMPT\n\ncartoon, CGI, 3D render, AI-looking, fake mirror video, visible face, partial face, eyes visible, nose visible, mouth visible, chin visible, cheeks visible, jawline visible, side profile face, face reveal, phone moved away from face, distorted mirror reflection, warped body, deformed hands, extra fingers, missing fingers, floating bag, wrong bag color, wrong bag shape, wrong logo, changing bag design, unstable background, flicker, jitter, low quality, blurry bag, text, subtitles, watermark, logo overlay\n\nThe final video must look like a real 10-second smartphone mirror-selfie fashion video generated from Image 1, while using Image 2 only to keep the handbag design perfectly accurate. The woman’s face must stay hidden behind the phone for the entire video.",
