          "slug": "prompt_assistant_3",
          "slug_auto": true,
          "node_name": "Prompt Assistant 3",
          "node_type": "prompt",
          "provider": null,
          "prompt": "Create a 10-second cinematic sneaker commercial video based on the uploaded reference shoe image.\n\nREFERENCE SHOE LOCK:\nThe uploaded shoe is the only product identity reference. Preserve the exact shoe silhouette, colors, material, stitching, lace style, sole shape, outsole shape, logo placement if visible, panel structure, and proportions throughout the entire video. Do not redesign, recolor, simplify, stylize, or replace the shoe.\n\nSTRICT COLOR AND MATERIAL LOCK:\nKeep the true product color and material exactly as shown in the reference image. Do not make the shoe brighter, darker, warmer, cooler, glossier, more plastic, or more stylized. Preserve the exact mesh, leather, suede, knit, canvas, rubber, foam, or mixed-material areas exactly as shown in the reference.\n\nWARDROBE CONSISTENCY LOCK:\nWhen the shoes are worn on feet, the wearer must wear fitted full-length athletic leggings in matte black or dark charcoal.\nThe leggings must look clean, sporty, modern, and minimal.\nThe leggings must remain the same from the first wearing shot to the first step shot.\nDo not change the pants into jeans, joggers, cargo pants, shorts, loose trousers, wide-leg pants, skirt, or any other outfit.\nNo outfit change. No color change. No pattern change.\nOnly lower body is shown. No face shown.\n\nVIDEO STYLE:\nPremium urban sneaker campaign, cinematic sportswear advertising, realistic product texture, cool neutral color grading, soft highlights, shallow depth of field, clean reflections, polished but realistic, not fake CGI.\n\nIMPORTANT PACING:\nAI video often moves too slowly, so keep the pacing clear and slightly faster than natural. Use snappy commercial cuts. Do not make the unboxing too slow. Each shot should last around 1 to 2 seconds.\n\nFORMAT:\nVertical 9:16 commercial video, 10 seconds, no subtitles, no storyboard grid, no text overlay, no fake brand names.\n\nTIMELINE:\n\n0.0s–1.3s — Top-down unboxing:\nA clean premium shoe box slides into frame on a bright minimal surface. Hands hold the box. Soft window shadows. Camera slowly pushes in.\n\n1.3s–2.8s — Box opening:\nThe lid opens. Tissue paper is lifted naturally. The mood is premium and controlled, but not too slow.\n\n2.8s–4.2s — First product reveal:\nThe reference shoes are revealed inside the box. Camera cuts closer to the shoes, clearly showing the exact product design, true color, material texture, stitching, laces, and sole shape.\n\n4.2s–5.8s — Macro product details:\nFast cinematic close-ups of the shoe upper, stitching, laces, tongue, toe box, logo placement if visible, sole edge, and material texture. The shoe remains sharp and consistent.\n\n5.8s–7.7s — Wearing the shoes:\nThe shoes are now on feet. The wearer is wearing fitted matte black or dark charcoal athletic leggings. Hands tie the laces naturally. No face shown. Low-angle close-up focused on the shoes and leggings.\n\n7.7s–10.0s — First step transition:\nThe wearer takes the first confident step onto a slightly wet reflective urban surface. The same black athletic leggings remain visible and unchanged. Subtle water movement and reflection under the shoe. End with the shoe firmly planted, ready for the next action scene.\n\nCAMERA:\nTop-down unboxing, close product reveal, macro lens details, low-angle wearing shot, reflective first-step shot, smooth commercial cuts.\n\nMOTION:\nNatural hand movement, clean lace tying, one confident first step. Keep motion realistic and slightly faster than normal AI default.\n\nNEGATIVE PROMPT:\nNo shoe deformation, no changing shoe color, no changed material, no wrong sole shape, no fake logo, no extra text, no mismatched shoes, no warped laces, no melted stitching, no random face, no outfit change, no changing leggings, no jeans, no joggers, no cargo pants, no shorts, no loose trousers, no wide-leg pants, no patterned pants, no slow boring pacing, no excessive slow motion, no cartoon style, no plastic CGI look.",
          "prompt_mode": "all",
