          "slug_auto": true,
          "node_name": "Prompt Assistant 4",
          "node_type": "prompt",
          "provider": null,
          "prompt": "Create a 10-second cinematic sneaker commercial video based on the uploaded reference shoe image.\n\nREFERENCE SHOE LOCK:\nThe uploaded shoe is the only product identity reference. Preserve the exact shoe silhouette, colors, material, stitching, lace style, sole shape, outsole shape, logo placement if visible, panel structure, and proportions throughout the entire video. The shoe must match Video Part 1 exactly. Do not redesign, recolor, simplify, stylize, or replace the shoe.\n\nSTRICT COLOR AND MATERIAL LOCK:\nKeep the true product color and material exactly as shown in the reference image. Do not make the shoe brighter, darker, warmer, cooler, glossier, more plastic, or more stylized. Preserve the exact mesh, leather, suede, knit, canvas, rubber, foam, or mixed-material areas exactly as shown in the reference.\n\nWARDROBE CONSISTENCY LOCK:\nThe wearer must wear the same fitted full-length athletic leggings throughout the entire video.\nThe leggings are matte black or dark charcoal sports leggings, clean and modern.\nThe leggings must remain identical in every shot: same color, same slim fit, same fabric texture, same length, same sporty look.\nDo not change into jeans, joggers, cargo pants, shorts, loose trousers, wide-leg pants, skirt, or different sportswear.\nNo outfit change. No color change. No pattern change.\nOnly lower body is shown. No face shown.\n\nCONTINUITY:\nThis video continues directly after Video Part 1. Start with the shoes already being worn on feet in the same urban environment. Keep the same reference shoes, same black athletic leggings, same wet reflective pavement, and same cool cinematic lighting.\n\nVIDEO STYLE:\nPremium urban sneaker campaign, cinematic sportswear advertising, cool blue-gray tone, wet pavement reflections, realistic material texture, dynamic movement, sharp product focus, polished but realistic.\n\nIMPORTANT PACING:\nAI video often moves slowly, so keep the pacing energetic and commercial. Use quick cuts every 1 to 1.5 seconds. Only use slow motion during the water splash moment. Avoid long slow walking shots.\n\nFORMAT:\nVertical 9:16 commercial video, 10 seconds, no subtitles, no storyboard grid, no text overlay, no fake brand names.\n\nTIMELINE:\n\n0.0s–1.3s — Low-angle walking:\nClose low-angle tracking shot beside the reference shoes walking on wet urban pavement. The same matte black athletic leggings are visible above the shoes. Reflections shimmer on the ground.\n\n1.3s–2.6s — Side motion close-up:\nSide tracking shot of the shoe moving forward. The shoe remains sharp while the background has subtle motion blur. Exact shoe color, sole shape, lace style, and material stay unchanged. The black leggings remain consistent.\n\n2.6s–4.0s — Fast stair action:\nLow-angle rear shot of the wearer running up modern city stairs. Show heel, outsole, side profile, ankle area, and the same fitted black athletic leggings clearly. Movement is sporty and confident.\n\n4.0s–5.3s — Urban stride:\nLower-body wide shot of the wearer walking fast through a modern city walkway. Focus stays on the shoes and leggings. No face shown. No outfit change.\n\n5.3s–7.0s — Hero splash:\nThe shoe lands in a shallow puddle. Water splashes dramatically in slow motion. Droplets fly around the sole. The shoe remains clear, accurate, and not distorted. The same black athletic leggings remain visible and unchanged.\n\n7.0s–8.2s — Outsole macro:\nExtreme close-up of the outsole tread and sidewall moving past camera. Crisp texture, technical product detail, realistic rubber finish.\n\n8.2s–10.0s — Final hero product shot:\nCut to a clean studio-style product hero shot. The reference shoe stands in perfect side profile on a glossy reflective surface. Bold abstract premium background. Slow push-in and fade out.\n\nCAMERA:\nLow-angle tracking, side close-up, rear stair action, lower-body urban wide shot, slow-motion splash, macro outsole, final product hero.\n\nMOTION:\nEnergetic but realistic. Keep movement slightly faster than normal AI default. Avoid floating feet, distorted walking, unnatural ankle bending, wardrobe flickering, or inconsistent shoe identity.\n\nNEGATIVE PROMPT:\nNo shoe deformation, no changing shoe color, no altered material, no wrong sole shape, no fake logo, no extra text, no mismatched shoes, no warped laces, no melted stitching, no random face, no outfit change, no changing leggings, no jeans, no joggers, no cargo pants, no shorts, no loose trousers, no wide-leg pants, no patterned pants, no different clothing between shots, no slow boring pacing, no excessive slow motion, no unrealistic walking, no distorted water physics, no cartoon style, no plastic CGI look.",
