          "provider": null,
          "prompt": "Use the supplied image as the strict first-frame reference and visual source of truth.\n\nFORMAT AND STYLE\n\nDuration: 6 seconds.\nAspect ratio: 9:16 vertical.\nSingle continuous cinematic shot.\nRealistic cinematic 3D CG animation.\nHigh-detail fur, woven fabric, distressed denim, metal jewelry, polished automotive paint, concrete and reflective floor materials.\nCold underground parking garage lighting with fluorescent ceiling fixtures.\nCool blue-grey industrial color palette with high contrast.\nSubtle cinematic film grain.\nSmooth stabilized camera movement.\nNo subtitles.\nNo dialogue.\nAmbient sound only: distant engine sound, tire friction, garage echo, faint fluorescent electrical hum and subtle fabric movement.\n\nCHARACTER LOCK\n\nPreserve both characters exactly as shown in the reference image.\n\nCharacter A:\nthe tall grey-blue anthropomorphic cat in the center foreground, wearing black sunglasses, royal-blue hoodie, gold chain, distressed dark jeans and blue-grey high-top sneakers.\n\nCharacter B:\nthe small brown anthropomorphic mouse positioned behind and to the right, wearing round sunglasses, black BOSS cap, black hoodie, gold chain and white sneakers.\n\nMaintain the exact faces, fur colors, ear shapes, body proportions, clothing, accessories, footwear and size relationship from the reference image.\n\nCharacter A must remain much taller and larger than Character B.\n\nDo not transform either character into a human.\nDo not change their clothing.\nDo not change their facial features.\nDo not duplicate, remove or deform any limb.\nDo not make either character slide or float.\n\nVEHICLE LOCK\n\nA neon-green Lamborghini-inspired exotic supercar approaches from the far background directly behind the two characters.\n\nThe vehicle must have:\nlow and wide supercar proportions,\nsharp angular bodywork,\nbright neon-green metallic paint,\ndark tinted windows,\nblack aerodynamic wheels,\nbright white LED headlights,\nrealistic reflections from the fluorescent ceiling lights,\na premium aggressive appearance.\n\nAttach one small aerodynamic flag to the rear of the car.\n\nThe flag must clearly display the exact text:\n\nSEOSONA Flow\n\nThe flag must remain attached to the car and move naturally in the airflow.\nDo not place the text anywhere else.\nDo not misspell, distort or replace the word SEOSONA Flow.\n\nSHOT TIMELINE\n\n0.0–1.2 seconds\n\nBegin from the exact composition of the reference image.\n\nCharacter A stands confidently in the center foreground, looking directly into the camera.\n\nCharacter B stands behind and to the right, keeping the thoughtful hand-on-chin pose.\n\nBoth characters remain calm and almost motionless, with only subtle breathing, tiny fur movement and minimal natural clothing motion.\n\nThe camera performs a very slow cinematic push-in.\n\nIn the far center background, a pair of small bright headlights becomes visible between the concrete columns.\n\n1.2–3.2 seconds\n\nThe neon-green supercar rapidly approaches from deep in the parking garage along the center lane behind the two characters.\n\nIts engine sound grows louder and echoes naturally through the garage.\n\nThe car remains perfectly aligned behind the characters and gradually increases in scale as it approaches.\n\nThe flag marked SEOSONA Flow streams backward in the airflow.\n\nCharacter A and Character B do not turn around or react with fear.\n\nCharacter A maintains a cold, confident expression.\n\nCharacter B gives only a tiny upward glance while remaining composed.\n\nThe camera continues a subtle stabilized push-in without shaking.\n\n3.2–4.5 seconds\n\nThe supercar closes the remaining distance quickly, then performs a controlled hard brake directly behind the two characters.\n\nThe front end dips slightly under braking.\n\nThe wheels stop rotating naturally.\n\nA brief soft tire squeal and a small amount of light tire smoke appear near the floor.\n\nThe vehicle must stop safely with a clear gap behind Character A and Character B.\n\nDo not hit, touch or pass through either character.\n\nDo not obscure the characters with excessive smoke.\n\nThe headlights create a dramatic rim light around their silhouettes.\n\n4.5–6.0 seconds\n\nThe supercar remains stationary immediately behind the two characters, centered in the background.\n\nIts neon-green body and sharp LED headlights are now clearly visible.\n\nThe SEOSONA Flow flag settles with a few small natural movements.\n\nCharacter A subtly raises the chin and slightly adjusts the angle of the sunglasses with one controlled hand movement, then returns to a confident stance.\n\nCharacter B makes a tiny cool head tilt while keeping the hand near the chin.\n\nThe camera gently dollies back just enough to reveal more of the car while keeping both characters dominant in the foreground.\n\nEnd on a powerful hero composition:\nCharacter A centered in the foreground,\nCharacter B smaller on the right,\nneon-green supercar directly behind them,\nheadlights creating cool dramatic backlight,\nSEOSONA Flow flag visible above or beside the rear of the car,\nall elements sharp, stylish and visually balanced.\n\nMOTION RULES\n\nOne uninterrupted shot.\nNo cuts.\nNo teleporting.\nNo sudden car appearance.\nNo camera whip-pan.\nNo background warping.\nNo character morphing.\nNo vehicle deformation.\nNo changing wheel count.\nNo changing car color.\nNo extra vehicles.\nNo collisions.\nNo explosive braking.\nNo exaggerated smoke.\nNo exaggerated character reactions.\nNo dialogue.\nNo lip-sync.\nNo dancing.\nNo human drivers visible.\nNo text except SEOSONA Flow on the attached flag.",
