          "node_type": "prompt",
          "provider": null,
          "prompt": "Use the provided location reference image and recreate the same scene with the camera, framing, perspective and permanent environmental elements locked exactly to the reference.\n\nShow the area before the cleanup begins. The ground contains a large amount of scattered removable waste, including plastic bags, paper, cardboard, disposable containers, bottles, leaves and mixed street litter. The trash should appear naturally accumulated according to the terrain and layout of the reference location, without blocking or altering permanent structures.\n\nSeveral sanitation workers have just arrived at the scene. They wear consistent work uniforms, protective gloves and practical footwear. Some workers are unloading brooms, shovels, large trash bags, waste bins and a cleaning cart. Other workers are standing near the most heavily littered areas and preparing to begin.\n\nThe scene must clearly communicate the starting condition: approximately 100% of the removable trash is still present.\n\nPreserve sufficient identifiable objects and trash clusters so their removal progress can be tracked accurately in the following storyboard images.\n\nNo text, captions, logos or signs added to the image.",
