          "slug_auto": true,
          "node_name": "Prompt Assistant",
          "node_type": "prompt",
          "provider": null,
          "prompt": "Using the completed building reference, recreate the exact same location after the previous building has been completely demolished.\n\nKeep the camera absolutely identical.\n\nPreserve without any change:\n\nneighboring buildings\nstreet\nsidewalks\nroad markings\nutility poles\npower cables\nsky\nambient lighting\nperspective\nframing\ncomposition\n\nRemove the entire building only.\n\nReplace it with a clean rectangular vacant construction lot.\n\nVisible details:\n\ncompacted dirt\nlight gravel\nconstruction boundary markers\ntemporary wooden stakes\nsimple construction fence at the back\nslight excavation marks\nno vegetation\n\nThe empty lot should occupy exactly the same footprint as the future building.\n\nEverything surrounding the lot remains unchanged.\n\nPhotorealistic architectural photography.",
