          "slug": "prompt_assistant_4",
          "slug_auto": true,
          "node_name": "Prompt Assistant 4",
          "node_type": "prompt",
          "provider": null,
          "prompt": "Frame Start = Image from Step 1\n\nStarting from the empty construction lot, create a realistic architectural construction timelapse.\n\nThe camera remains perfectly locked.\n\nConstruction progresses continuously:\n\nsite preparation\n\nground excavation\n\nworkers measuring\n\nrebar installation\n\nconcrete formwork\n\nfoundation pouring\n\nfoundation curing\n\nunderground utilities installed\n\nconcrete slab completed\n\nThe sequence ends with only the completed foundation.\n\nNo walls.\n\nNo columns above ground except necessary foundation stubs.\n\nThe surrounding street remains unchanged.\n\nFast but smooth timelapse.\n\nNo jumping between stages.\n\nThe final frame is a completed foundation ready for vertical construction.",
