          "node_name": "Prompt Assistant 5",
          "node_type": "prompt",
          "provider": null,
          "prompt": "Frame Start = Last Frame Step 2\n\nContinue the construction seamlessly from the completed foundation.\n\nMaintain the identical camera.\n\nConstruction sequence:\n\nreinforced concrete columns rise\n\nfloor slabs poured\n\nsecond floor completed\n\nthird floor completed\n\nstair core constructed\n\nreinforced concrete walls assembled\n\nexterior structural shell completed\n\ntemporary scaffolding surrounds the building\n\nconstruction materials gradually disappear\n\nThe building now has its complete structural form.\n\nOnly exposed unfinished concrete.\n\nNo glass.\n\nNo doors.\n\nNo window frames.\n\nNo interior finishes.\n\nNo exterior lighting.\n\nThe building appears as a finished structural shell awaiting finishing work.\n\nSmooth realistic timelapse.",
