          "slug_auto": true,
          "node_name": "Prompt - Image",
          "node_type": "prompt",
          "provider": null,
          "prompt": "IMAGE 01 = the elevator mirror selfie reference image with the girl standing inside a stainless steel elevator, holding a phone covering her face, wearing a fluffy cream oversized sweater, beige mini skirt, and knee-high boots.\n\nIMAGE 02 = the uploaded outfit reference image that will replace the current clothing on the model.\n\nUse IMAGE 01 as the primary reference for:\n\n* elevator environment\n* mirror selfie composition\n* camera angle\n* body pose\n* hair style\n* lighting mood\n* body proportions\n* hidden-face aesthetic\n* overall realistic fashion vibe\n* original person identity\n\nUse IMAGE 02 as the exact outfit replacement reference.\nReplace ONLY the clothing and accessories on the model from IMAGE 01 using the outfit from IMAGE 02 while fully preserving:\n\n* the original person\n* original pose\n* original body shape\n* original hair\n* original elevator background\n* original framing and composition\n* original lighting direction\n* original mirror selfie perspective\n\nThe final image must look like the same real person from IMAGE 01 naturally wearing the outfit from IMAGE 02 inside the same elevator scene.\n\nIMPORTANT OUTFIT RULES:\n\n* preserve all outfit details from IMAGE 02 exactly\n* preserve fabric texture, stitching, folds, silhouette, fit, layering, and accessories\n* do not redesign or reinterpret the outfit\n* do not simplify clothing details\n* maintain accurate garment proportions\n* outfit must realistically wrap around the existing body pose\n* preserve realistic fabric tension and gravity\n\nPHONE REQUIREMENT:\nReplace the original phone with an iPhone 17 Pro Max in elegant desert orange / soft orange titanium color.\nThe phone should look premium, realistic, and naturally held in front of the face.\nMaintain the same hidden-face mirror selfie composition.\n\nREALISM REQUIREMENTS:\n\n* ultra realistic fashion photography\n* indistinguishable from a real iPhone mirror selfie\n* natural skin texture\n* realistic lighting and shadows\n* realistic stainless steel elevator reflections\n* realistic hair strands\n* natural body proportions\n* authentic mirror reflection behavior\n* realistic fabric wrinkles and movement\n* no AI artifacts\n* no distorted anatomy\n* no warped elevator background\n* no fake glossy skin\n* no plastic texture\n* no unrealistic fingers or hands\n* no over-beautified face\n\nSTYLE:\nLuxury Korean fashion influencer mirror selfie, premium Instagram fashion aesthetic, cozy minimal luxury mood, realistic smartphone photography, natural cinematic lighting, authentic social media fashion content, soft neutral tones, elegant feminine styling.",
