          "node_name": "Prompt - Video 01",
          "node_type": "prompt",
          "provider": null,
          "prompt": "IMAGE 01 = the elevator mirror selfie reference image with the girl standing inside a stainless steel elevator, holding a phone covering her face, wearing a fluffy cream oversized sweater, beige mini skirt, and knee-high boots.\n\nIMAGE 02 = the uploaded outfit reference image that will replace the current clothing on the model.\n\nUse IMAGE 01 as the primary reference for:\n\n* elevator environment\n* mirror selfie framing\n* hidden-face aesthetic\n* camera angle\n* pose style\n* body proportions\n* hair style\n* lighting mood\n* original person identity\n* overall luxury fashion vibe\n\nUse IMAGE 02 as the exact outfit replacement reference.\nReplace ONLY the outfit from IMAGE 01 with the outfit from IMAGE 02 while preserving:\n\n* the same real person\n* same pose style\n* same hair\n* same body shape\n* same elevator background\n* same mirror selfie composition\n* same camera perspective\n* same lighting direction\n\nThe final video must look like the same real girl from IMAGE 01 naturally wearing the outfit from IMAGE 02 inside the same elevator environment.\n\nCreate a 10-second ultra realistic cinematic fashion reel filmed as a handheld mirror selfie inside a luxury stainless steel elevator.\n\nVIDEO STYLE:\n\n* ultra realistic fashion reel\n* realistic iPhone mirror selfie footage\n* cozy luxury Korean influencer vibe\n* cinematic soft lighting\n* realistic elevator reflections\n* smooth natural movement\n* handheld smartphone feel\n* ultra realistic fabric physics\n* not AI-looking\n\nPHONE REQUIREMENT:\nReplace the current phone with an iPhone 17 Pro Max in elegant desert orange / soft orange titanium color.\nThe phone must continuously cover the face during the entire video.\n\nSCENE FLOW:\n\n0s – 2s\nThe model stands casually in front of the mirror as if the elevator has just started moving. One leg crosses naturally in front of the other. Small body sway. Hair softly resting over the outfit.\n\n2s – 4s\nShe gently adjusts one sleeve or outfit detail naturally while slightly tilting her hips. The fabric from IMAGE 02 moves naturally and realistically.\n\n4s – 6s\nThe model slowly turns slightly sideways to showcase the silhouette of the outfit from IMAGE 02. Her free hand softly smooths the clothing fabric.\n\n6s – 8s\nShe subtly lifts one leg forward to highlight the lower outfit styling while the shoulder bag or accessories naturally move with body motion.\n\n8s – 10s\nFinal calm pose facing the mirror. Relaxed luxury fashion mood. Soft hair movement. Realistic reflections and natural fabric folds.\n\nIMPORTANT:\n\n* face always hidden behind the iPhone 17 Pro Max\n* preserve exact outfit details from IMAGE 02\n* preserve same person and same environment from IMAGE 01\n* realistic body movement only\n* no exaggerated acting\n* no AI artifacts\n* ultra realistic smartphone video aesthetic",
