          "provider": null,
          "prompt": "IMAGE 01 = the elevator mirror selfie reference image with the girl standing inside a stainless steel elevator, holding a phone covering her face.\n\nIMAGE 02 = the uploaded outfit reference image that will replace the current clothing on the model.\n\nUse IMAGE 01 as the primary reference for:\n\n* elevator environment\n* mirror selfie composition\n* hidden-face aesthetic\n* body proportions\n* pose style\n* lighting mood\n* hair style\n* realistic fashion vibe\n* original person identity\n\nUse IMAGE 02 as the exact outfit replacement reference.\nReplace ONLY the clothing and accessories while fully preserving the original girl, pose style, background, and mirror framing from IMAGE 01.\n\nCreate a 10-second ultra realistic vertical fashion video that feels like a continuation of VIDEO 01, filmed moments later inside the same elevator.\n\nSTYLE:\n\n* luxury Korean fashion influencer reel\n* calm feminine energy\n* realistic elevator reflections\n* premium soft indoor lighting\n* natural handheld phone movement\n* ultra realistic hair and fabric motion\n* indistinguishable from real smartphone footage\n\nPHONE REQUIREMENT:\nUse an iPhone 17 Pro Max in elegant desert orange titanium color.\nThe phone must fully cover the face during the entire video.\n\nSCENE FLOW:\n\n0s – 2s\nThe model stands slightly closer to the mirror than before. One shoulder lowered naturally, creating a relaxed oversized styling silhouette.\n\n2s – 4s\nShe softly flips part of her hair behind one shoulder while leaning slightly toward the mirror. The phone still fully hides the face.\n\n4s – 5.5s\nThe model gently adjusts the shoulder bag or outfit accessory while slowly turning her body sideways to reveal the silhouette and texture of the outfit from IMAGE 02.\n\n5.5s – 7s\nShe lightly touches the outfit fabric and smooths it naturally, showcasing realistic material texture and fit.\n\n7s – 8.5s\nThe model bends one knee slightly and shifts weight naturally, highlighting the lower part of the styling and silhouette in a relaxed fashion pose.\n\n8.5s – 10s\nFinal close mirror pose. Calm luxury mood. Slight body tilt. Natural outfit folds and soft hair movement.\n\nIMPORTANT:\n\n* maintain same outfit and elevator continuity\n* preserve exact outfit details from IMAGE 02\n* preserve same girl from IMAGE 01\n* no dramatic movement\n* realistic influencer-style posing only\n* face fully hidden entire video\n* realistic proportions and reflections\n* no AI-looking textures or movements",
