          "prompt": "Write a 20-25s vertical product-ad script for {product} using the PAIN-POINT archetype. Beat 1 (0-3s): show a high-friction BEFORE state (the problem in action). Beat 2 (3-18s): introduce the product as a calm resolution, contrast messy-before vs clean-after (a quiet fix, not a magic cure). Beat 3 (18-25s): the relieved after-state. Per shot: shot type + on-screen action + VO/on-screen text. No platform CTA (tap now/swipe up); end brand/emotion-led. Then output ONE video prompt for the strongest beat.",
